# A concentration cell vanishes at equality
# Expectation: Identical copper half-cells should give near-zero voltage; diluting one tenfold should produce a nonzero voltage of order tens of mV.
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL
add v1 CuSO4 0.001mol
add v1 Cu 0.001mol
new
add v2 water 100mL
add v2 CuSO4 0.001mol
add v2 Cu 0.001mol
cell v1 v2
dilute v2 900mL
cell v1 v2
